{"seq":1,"slug":"holiday-shipping-cutoff-promise","title":"节日物流截单日与送达承诺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/holiday-logistics-marketing/holiday-shipping-cutoff-promise","wordCount":1848,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"节日物流截单日与送达承诺\">节日物流截单日与送达承诺</h1><p>「12 月 24 日前送达」这句话一旦写在前台，就从一个物流时效变成了一个<strong>商业承诺</strong>。它出现在商品页、出现在广告语、出现在客服话术里，而在它背后是一串分段时效的加总：揽收、出口报关、干线、进口清关、尾程派送。任何一段超时，承诺就违约；而跨境段中最不可控的那一段（清关）恰恰最容易被简单地按「经验天数」一笔带过。</p>\n<p>本篇处理截单日的计算与送达承诺的表述：截单日怎么分段推、跨境清关的时间怎么扣、承诺应该对外怎么说，以及怎么处理「已经承诺但送不到了」的异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>截单日（cutoff date）是「为了让货在目标到达日前送达，最晚必须交给承运商的日期」。它是从目标到达日向前逐段扣除得到的，每一段的时长都必须带不确定性的意识。</p>\n<p>目标到达日本身也不是常量。美国市场的节日送达承诺锚在圣诞（12 月 25 日）与感恩节（其日期由「十一月第四个星期四」的立法规则决定，逐年浮动）上，而<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thanksgiving_(United_States)\">感恩节日期规则</a>说明它最早落在 11 月 22 日、最晚落在 11 月 28 日。这意味着感恩节相关商品的承诺窗口在不同年份会整体前后移动近一周，截单日因此必须按「当年日历」而不是按「去年经验」生成——这也是第 1 章强调日历要作为带版本的年度主数据的原因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分段</th>\n<th>起点</th>\n<th>终点</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n<th>波动特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尾程派送</td>\n<td>到达目的国分拨</td>\n<td>收件人签收</td>\n<td>1–4 天</td>\n<td>中等，受天气影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口清关</td>\n<td>到港/到关</td>\n<td>放行</td>\n<td>1–7 天</td>\n<td>高，抽查时可达数周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线运输</td>\n<td>离开始发港</td>\n<td>到达目的国</td>\n<td>3–35 天</td>\n<td>高，取决于运输方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出口报关</td>\n<td>货物入监管区</td>\n<td>装运</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>揽收</td>\n<td>卖家交货</td>\n<td>进入承运网络</td>\n<td>0–1 天</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把表中各段相加，得到从揽收到签收的总时长，再加上目标到达日，反推即得截单日。关键判断在于：<strong>清关段必须用悲观分位数而不是均值</strong>。原因是清关的分布是长尾的——绝大多数货在两天内放行，但一旦被抽查就是数周。用均值会让截单日偏乐观，而乐观的截单日会带来承诺违约。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph RL&#10;  A[目标到达日] --&gt; B[扣尾程派送]&#10;  B --&gt; C[扣进口清关&lt;br/&gt;取 P90 而非均值]&#10;  C --&gt; D[扣干线运输&lt;br/&gt;按运输方式]&#10;  D --&gt; E[扣出口报关]&#10;  E --&gt; F[扣揽收缓冲]&#10;  F --&gt; G[截单日]&#10;  G --&gt; H{当前日期已过截单日}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[降级:升级运输方式或改承诺]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[正常受理]\">graph RL\n  A[目标到达日] --&gt; B[扣尾程派送]\n  B --&gt; C[扣进口清关&lt;br/&gt;取 P90 而非均值]\n  C --&gt; D[扣干线运输&lt;br/&gt;按运输方式]\n  D --&gt; E[扣出口报关]\n  E --&gt; F[扣揽收缓冲]\n  F --&gt; G[截单日]\n  G --&gt; H{当前日期已过截单日}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[降级:升级运输方式或改承诺]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[正常受理]</pre><h3 id=\"分段时长的数据结构\">分段时长的数据结构</h3><p>截单日计算涉及的参数会随承运商、航线、季节变化，因此不能硬编码，需要一张可版本化的时效参数表。它的结构与第 1 章的日历主数据保持一致——带生效期、带来源、下游冻结引用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE shipping_lane_transit (&#10;  lane_id           BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  origin_country    TEXT NOT NULL,        -- 如 CN&#10;  dest_country      TEXT NOT NULL,        -- 如 US&#10;  mode              TEXT NOT NULL         -- ocean | air | express&#10;                    CHECK (mode IN (&#39;ocean&#39;,&#39;air&#39;,&#39;express&#39;)),&#10;  segment           TEXT NOT NULL         -- pickup|export_clear|line_haul|import_clear|last_mile&#10;                    CHECK (segment IN (&#39;pickup&#39;,&#39;export_clear&#39;,&#39;line_haul&#39;,&#39;import_clear&#39;,&#39;last_mile&#39;)),&#10;  transit_days_p50  NUMERIC(5,1) NOT NULL,&#10;  transit_days_p90  NUMERIC(5,1) NOT NULL, -- 截单日用它&#10;  season            TEXT NOT NULL          -- off_peak | peak&#10;                    CHECK (season IN (&#39;off_peak&#39;,&#39;peak&#39;)),&#10;  carrier_code      TEXT,&#10;  source            TEXT NOT NULL,         -- 承运商公布时效或历史实测&#10;  valid_from        DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to          DATE,&#10;  UNIQUE (origin_country, dest_country, mode, segment, season, carrier_code, valid_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 截单日计算（时区统一在目的国当地日期上求值）&#10;SELECT MAX(target_arrival_date - INTERVAL &#39;1 day&#39; * SUM(transit_days_p90))&#10;         AS cutoff_local_date&#10;FROM shipping_lane_transit&#10;WHERE origin_country = :orig AND dest_country = :dest&#10;  AND mode = :mode AND season = :season&#10;  AND CURRENT_DATE BETWEEN valid_from AND COALESCE(valid_to, &#39;infinity&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shipping_lane_transit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lane_id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_country    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 CN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dest_country      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如 US</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- ocean | air | express</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ocean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'air'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'express'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  segment           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- pickup|export_clear|line_haul|import_clear|last_mile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (segment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pickup'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'export_clear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'line_haul'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'import_clear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'last_mile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_days_p50  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transit_days_p90  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 截单日用它</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  season            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          -- off_peak | peak</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (season </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'off_peak'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'peak'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 承运商公布时效或历史实测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (origin_country, dest_country, mode, segment, season, carrier_code, valid_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 截单日计算（时区统一在目的国当地日期上求值）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target_arrival_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(transit_days_p90))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cutoff_local_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipping_lane_transit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :orig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dest_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :dest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> season </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :season</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(valid_to, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'infinity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>transit_days_p90</code> 才是截单日该用的字段，<code>transit_days_p50</code> 用于给用户展示「一般几天到」的参考值。两个字段分开存储的理由是<strong>展示与承诺用不同口径</strong>：展示可以乐观（提升转化），承诺必须悲观（避免违约）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺的表述策略\">承诺的表述策略</h2><p>承诺有两种表述方式，它们对应的风险完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>日期承诺</strong>（&quot;Delivered by Dec 24&quot;）明确给出一个日期。它给用户最强的确定性，转化率最高，但也把违约风险完全暴露——差一天就是差一天，用户会记住。它适用于时效可高度控制的场景（境内、快件、合同舱位）。</p>\n<p><strong>区间承诺</strong>（&quot;Arrives Dec 18–22&quot;）给出一个范围。它对用户的心理契约更宽松，且实际提前到达会变成惊喜。代价是转化率略低，用户可能因为不确定而放弃。它适用于时效波动大的场景（跨境、海运、旺季）。</p>\n<p>实务中的最佳策略是<strong>分层承诺</strong>：对高确定性的商品与线路给日期承诺，对其余给区间承诺，并在结账页根据地址与运输方式动态选择。关键是承诺的生成必须由截单日逻辑驱动，而不是营销团队另定一套——两套口径并存是承诺违约最常见的成因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承诺类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>转化影响</th>\n<th>违约风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日期承诺</td>\n<td>12 月 24 日前送达</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>境内快件、合同运力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间承诺</td>\n<td>12 月 18–22 日送达</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>跨境海运、旺季</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件承诺</td>\n<td>今日下单，12 月 23 日前送达</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>有库存且截单日未到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不承诺</td>\n<td>预计 2–4 周</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>预售、定制、超长链路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"承诺与库存状态联动\">承诺与库存状态联动</h3><p>承诺不能只看时效，还必须看库存。同一线路、同一商品，若库存已在目的国海外仓，承诺可以很激进；若还在国内待发，承诺必须保守。因此承诺生成是一个三元函数：目的地 × 运输方式 × 库存位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sku_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-GIFT-BOX-A&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dest_country&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;  &quot;inventory_location&quot;: &quot;overseas_warehouse&quot;,&#10;  &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;last_mile_only&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target_arrival&quot;: &quot;2026-12-24&quot;,&#10;  &quot;cutoff_local_date&quot;: &quot;2026-12-19&quot;,&#10;  &quot;promise&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;date&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;2026-12-22&quot; },&#10;  &quot;computed_from&quot;: { &quot;transit_table_version&quot;: &quot;2026.0&quot;, &quot;calendar_version&quot;: &quot;2026.0&quot; },&#10;  &quot;fallback&quot;: { &quot;if_missed&quot;: &quot;credit_coupon&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-GIFT-BOX-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dest_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inventory_location\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overseas_warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last_mile_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target_arrival\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-12-24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cutoff_local_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-12-19\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"promise\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-12-22\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"computed_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"transit_table_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"if_missed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"credit_coupon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fallback</code> 字段是承诺体系的必备件：承诺违约时应该有一个预先定义好的补偿动作，而不是等客服临时决定。这个动作通常在结账页的条款中已向用户披露，因此它同时是合规要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"已过截单日的异常处理\">已过截单日的异常处理</h2><p>系统每天都会遇到「用户下单了，但按截单日算已经送不到目标日」的情况。这里的处理原则是<strong>在下单时拦截或降级，而不是在下单后补救</strong>。</p>\n<p>处理路径按优先级：先尝试<strong>升级运输方式</strong>（把最后一程改成空运或次日达），若时效仍不够则<strong>放宽承诺日期</strong>并明确告知用户，若用户不接受则<strong>取消订单并释放库存</strong>。三条路径必须在结账流程内完成判断，因为一旦订单生成后才发现承诺做不到，用户已经形成了期待，取消的体验代价远大于下单时的拦截。</p>\n<p>还有一种更隐蔽的失败：<strong>承诺做到了但库存不在</strong>。系统算出截单日还没过，就给了日期承诺，但实际上这批货在另一个仓，调拨过去需要三天。因此承诺生成的输入必须包含「可承诺库存」（available-to-promise）而不是「账面库存」，两者的差别在旺季尤其大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>截单日由目标到达日向前逐段扣除揽收、报关、干线、清关、尾程得到，每段都要考虑波动。</li>\n<li>清关段必须用悲观分位数（如 P90）而非均值，因为其分布长尾，一旦抽查就是数周。</li>\n<li>时效参数应存成带季节、承运商、生效期的表，<code>p50</code> 用于展示、<code>p90</code> 用于承诺，两者分开。</li>\n<li>承诺表述分日期、区间、条件、不承诺四类，应分层使用；承诺必须由截单日逻辑驱动，不能由营销另定口径。</li>\n<li>承诺生成是「目的地 × 运输方式 × 库存位置」的函数，输入必须是可承诺库存而非账面库存。</li>\n<li>已过截单日的处理必须在结账流程内完成：升级运输 → 放宽并告知 → 取消释放。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"节日物流截单日与送达承诺","id":"节日物流截单日与送达承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"分段时长的数据结构","id":"分段时长的数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺的表述策略","id":"承诺的表述策略"},{"level":3,"text":"承诺与库存状态联动","id":"承诺与库存状态联动"},{"level":2,"text":"已过截单日的异常处理","id":"已过截单日的异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大促容量压测与履约/人力预案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/seasonal-supply-readiness/festival-capacity-fulfill-plan"},"next":{"title":"节日营销节奏与本地化创意","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/holiday-logistics-marketing/festival-campaign-localization-rhythm"}}